  "details": "I believe an RGB slider for the GUI would be a cool thing to add... in theory it shouldn't be that hard, maybe an extra icon on the current GUI with the RGB Values represented as sliders and saved via client-side through a config file. I'm going to post a few photoshop representations of what it might look like. The first is the original and the rest are examples of the end result.\nOriginal: https://gyazo.com/43da50f252aeca95e1bc311e1187062b\nPink: https://gyazo.com/40fd2434877f00ef296a81597d0e9b49\nRed: https://gyazo.com/fc92f778996929113f8fecdb74c2ebd3\nGreen: https://gyazo.com/8ec2b2b4f26cac3d1a323916185aa939\nDark Blue: https://gyazo.com/62969a9528196f3a1e3b426fae7600ce",
